中也。君不如遣春平君而留平都。春平君者言行信於王，王必厚割趙而贖平都。」文信侯曰：「善。」因遣之。城韓皋。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"李牧","kind":"person","person_id":"hph_y6n_3zb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"春平君","kind":"person","person_id":"bro_0ln_j9p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"泄鈞","kind":"person","person_id":"63o_tsj_qtc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"文信侯","kind":"person","person_id":"goj_kf0_ild","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"春平君","kind":"person","person_id":"bro_0ln_j9p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"q6w_qm5_w2b_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"郎中","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職稱與匿名詞保留；未名者不補熟知姓名。述贊省稱限本篇對讀，不另增加事件或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0060","start":60,"end":63,"surface":"春平君","kind":"person","person_id":"bro_0ln_j9p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0091","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"郎中","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職稱與匿名詞保留；未名者不補熟知姓名。述贊省稱限本篇對讀，不另增加事件或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0102","start":102,"end":105,"surface":"春平君","kind":"person","person_id":"bro_0ln_j9p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"平都","kind":"person","person_id":"z00_soe_xo2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m113-0110","start":110,"end":113,"surface":"春平君","kind":"person","person_id":"bro_0ln_j9p","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"